        "type": "reg",
        "input": "1 3 1000000007",
        "output": "2",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nThe two possible grids are:\n\n{{R, G, B}} : Choose the tuple (1,1,(1, 1, (1,1, right))).\n{{B, G, R}} : Choose the tuple (1,3,(1, 3, (1,3, left)))."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
